            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed are formulations comprising brincidofovir. The formulations can be intravenous formulations. The formulations can be used in cases where a subject experiences gastrointestinal issues in response to oral administration of brincidofovir. The formulations can also be used in cases where oral administration of drug is not possible due to underlying conditions or concern around inadequate oral absorption.</p>
            </abstract>
